<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Emmis rating cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Emmis rating cut on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said analyst Rita Zanella downgraded Emmis Broadcasting Corp to neutral from long-term outperform.</p>
<p>-- cited the appreciation in the stock price.</p>
<p>-- shares were off 1/4 to 52-1/4 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
